  "remarks": "\nFormer Chairman of the Commonwealth of Independent States (CIS) Committee of the State Duma of the Russian Federation (member of the LDPR). Actively supporting use of Russian Armed Forces in Ukraine and voted in favour of the incorporation of Crimea into the Russian Federation. Currently Chairperson of the Foreign Affairs Committee of the State Duma of the Russian Federation. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
